      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T01:49:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why does this use the word \"required\"? Only the caller knows which redactions are actually required at any point in time. So this method looks like it returns the list of which redactions *might* be necessary.\n\nDo we have a better word for this? getSupportedRedactions? getRelevantRedactions? getApplicableRedactions?\n\nDon\u0027t feel super strongly about this, and API council will have an opinion anyway, so I think it\u0027s probably fine to leave as is.",
